  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you reanimate a corpse, its remains shift to suit your purposes.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere (Undead Body), Death sphere; or Alteration sphere, Death sphere (Corpse Manipulation).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you reanimate a dead body, you may apply a single trait you have access to through the Alteration sphere to the new skeleton or zombie as a polymorph effect; this effect remains as long as the undead stays reanimated. When reanimating multiple bodies at once, you must grant each body the same trait. As a standard action, you can touch an undead you control benefiting from this effect to change the trait granted.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc98\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
